(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Investigators explored brief sleep restriction therapy against standard care in 100 adults) Tj
T*
(with insomnia in older adults. The intervention showed a small but measurable benefit for) Tj
T*
(sleep efficiency, while treatment exposure and adverse events were broadly comparable) Tj
T*
(between groups. Generalisability may be reduced because participating sites had established) Tj
T*
(research infrastructure. The investigators noted that the observed association should not be) Tj
T*
(interpreted as proof of causation. This report is from a parallel-group randomized) Tj
T*
(controlled trial comparing Control: usual care vs Intervention: CBT + educational material.) Tj
